            "detailed_description": "<h1>Oferta especial</h1><p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT IS DRAGON HUNT?</h2><br>DRAGON HUNT is a classic bricks destroying game, where to win a level you need to destroy the so called dragon stones (yellow and red bricks)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE SETTING</h2><br>The world of Dragon Hunt is set in cyber space with 18 levels to complete.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE GAME</h2><br>You use arrow or WSAD keys to rotate the wheel and the game is very easy to learn.<br><br>As you progress through the levels it will get harder and harder to master the game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><br>Classic brick destroying game<br><br>Multiple types of stones (bricks) to destroy<br><br>18 levels to complete<br><br>Easy to learn, hard to master with each level increasing difficulty and complexity",
